window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I threw a penny into a fountain, and ended up abducted by a group of fae called the Wild Hunt.<br> <br> They dragged me into their world and made me one of them.<br> <br> And then, they started hunting me.<br> <br> I managed to convince their leader to take me somewhere safe, but after I got there, he revealed the price of his help:</p> <p>Me.<br> <br> I thought their hunt was going to be the death of me, but it turns out there's nothing more dangerous than a male fae who has decided you're his mate.</p> <p>This is the first in a series of steamy connected standalones. Humor and happily-ever-after guaranteed. </p>"; 
